     1990       bfspc_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-base-doc    = bfs_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-base-doc    - bfs_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-base-acc
     1991       bfspc_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-rubl-doc    = bfs_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-rubl-doc    - bfs_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-rubl-acc
